<title>USA: U.S. insurance stocks up sharply on rates, markets.</title>
<headline>U.S. insurance stocks up sharply on rates, markets.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>A couple of U.S. insurance stocks were among the top gainers on the New York Stock Exchange on Thursday as the interest rate sensitive sector benefited from a bond market rally and strength in the overall stock market, analysts said.</p>
<p>The benchmark 30-year U.S. Treasury rose 1-2/32 with the yield falling to 6.76 percent from 6.84 percent.</p>
<p>Certain insurance stocks tend to be highly attuned to moves in interest rates, analysts said.</p>
